    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Pure manual map, without using automatically generated maps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Pure manual system, easy to adjust</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes a puzzle mission and an FPS shooting mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >puzzle mission: In a space with supernatural phenomena, as an observer, when a supernatural event occurs, you need to click on the correct options and actions to report the supernatural event. If the selection is incorrect, you may fail the misson.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FPS Shooting Mission: You will infiltrate these supernatural spaces, wield weapons, shoot monsters, and monsters will attack you. If operated improperly, you will die.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Pure manual map, without using automatically generated maps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Pure manual system, easy to adjust</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes a puzzle mission and an FPS shooting mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >puzzle mission: In a space with supernatural phenomena, as an observer, when a supernatural event occurs, you need to click on the correct options and actions to report the supernatural event. If the selection is incorrect, you may fail the misson.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FPS Shooting Mission: You will infiltrate these supernatural spaces, wield weapons, shoot monsters, and monsters will attack you. If operated improperly, you will die.</p>",
    "short_description": "This is a horror game that will take you into a world full of suspense, thrills, and psychological challenges, testing your courage and wisdom, uncovering secrets that have been sealed by time. -Pure manual map, without using automatically generated maps -Pure manual system, easy to adjust",
